  "content": "<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/kgPmdbHD/lios-seafaring-dungeons.png\" alt=\"lios-seafaring-dungeons\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">欢迎来到<strong>Lio's Seafaring Dungeons</strong>（Lio的海上地牢）！本模组为您的Minecraft世界增添了多种新的地牢，包括水下和地下地牢。您将发现充满独特战利品、具有挑战性的敌人以及等待征服的Boss房间的定制结构。</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/pBZGPGy1/dungeon-types.png\" alt=\"dungeon-types\" width=\"464\" height=\"38\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>长满青苔的海洋地牢</strong> &ndash; 这些地牢生成于温暖的气候海洋中</li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>砂岩海洋地牢</strong> &ndash; 存在于寒冷的气候海洋中</li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>地下陆地地牢</strong> &ndash; 分布在地表之下的大型广阔地牢</li>\n</ul>\n<div style=\"border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.12)\"><a style=\"display:flex;text-decoration:none\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lioloader\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"display:block\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/wrK85wgc/logo.png\" alt=\"LioLoader\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\">\n<div style=\"text-align:left;line-height:1.35\">\n<div style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:bold\">需要基于数据包配置？</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:14px\">请查看<strong>LioLoader</strong>，以实现全局数据包/资源包加载。适用于<strong>Minecraft 1.21.x</strong>的<strong>NeoForge</strong>和<strong>Fabric</strong>平台。</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:13px\">在 CurseForge 上打开 LioLoader &rarr;</div>\n</div>\n</a></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://url-shortener.curseforge.com/xiKHo\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/gFGT7zG/bisecthosting.png\" alt=\"bisecthosting\" width=\"803\" height=\"77\"> </a></p>\n<p><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/fV6VtS4Q/youtube-reviews.png\" alt=\"youtube-reviews\" width=\"605\" height=\"44\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<div><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Xhst1_TfmcE?start=1117\" width=\"560\" height=\"315\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></div>\n<div><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/E-ycJzZalDg\" width=\"560\" height=\"315\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<h2><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fsPHes7q4Pr\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/qDNhg49/636e0a6a49cf127bf92de1e2-icon-clyde-blurple-RGB.png\" width=\"128\" height=\"97\"><br></a></h2>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/hJvQHRN5/usageinmodpacks.png\" alt=\"usageinmodpacks\" width=\"602\" height=\"41\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><br></strong>本模组可自由用于任何整合包，无需许可。欢迎在任何地方使用，尽情享受Lio的海上地牢带来的所有乐趣！</p>",
